@informal thm:generic-arrow-recovery-and-fiber-obstruction: At order \(2m+2\), the same-arrow fiber preserves the unordered finite loading-slope multiset, while direct-slot and middle-slot swaps give residual ambiguity beyond admissible middle-source relabelling.

